<title>UK: LONDON COAL/ORE FIXTURES.</title>
<headline>LONDON COAL/ORE FIXTURES.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>COAL - Endeavour 110,000/10 tonnes coal Hampton Roads/Taranto 15/30 Aug $6.25 fio 30,000 shinc/30,000 shinc Coe and Clerici.</p>
<p>ORE - North Gate - 170,000/10 tonnes ore Punta da Madeira/Rotterdam 15/30 Sept $5.25 fio 7 days shinc Rohstoffhandel.</p>
